" 10 &middot; 初月の&times;2.9\"><circle class=\"mlc-dot\" cx=\"571.0\" cy=\"106.8\" r=\"4.5\"/><rect class=\"mlc-hit\" x=\"542.2\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"57.7\" height=\"248.0\"/></g>\n      <g class=\"mlc-pt\" data-tip=\" 11 &middot; 初月の&times;3.2\"><circle class=\"mlc-dot\" cx=\"628.7\" cy=\"91.5\" r=\"4.5\"/><rect class=\"mlc-hit\" x=\"599.8\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"57.7\" height=\"248.0\"/></g>\n      <g class=\"mlc-pt\" data-tip=\" 12 &middot; 初月の&times;3.4\"><circle class=\"mlc-dot\" cx=\"686.3\" cy=\"77.7\" r=\"4.5\"/><rect class=\"mlc-hit\" x=\"657.5\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"57.7\" height=\"248.0\"/></g>\n      <g class=\"mlc-pt\" data-tip=\" 13 &middot; 初月の&times;4.2\"><circle class=\"mlc-dot\" cx=\"744.0\" cy=\"36.3\" r=\"4.5\"/><rect class=\"mlc-hit\" x=\"715.2\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"57.7\" height=\"248.0\"/></g>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"mlc-tip\" hidden></div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"mlc-note\">MacroLingo クライアント1社の Google Search Console クリック数（13か月）。実数は非公開のため、初月を1とした倍率で示しています。</p>\n  <p class=\"mlc-ylab\">クリック数（初月比）</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n/* One listener for the whole chart: the points are <g> elements carrying\n   their own text, so nothing here knows anything about the data. Touch\n   counts as hover, and the tip is clamped inside the plot so a point at\n   either end does not push it off the card. */\n(function () {\n  var host = document.currentScript && document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;\n  if (!host || !host.hasAttribute('data-mlc')) {\n    var all = document.querySelectorAll('[data-mlc]');\n    host = all[all.length - 1];\n  }\n  if (!host || host.dataset.mlcReady) { return; }\n  host.dataset.mlcReady = '1';\n  var plot = host.querySelector('.mlc-plot');\n  var tip  = host.querySelector('.mlc-tip');\n  function show(g, ev) {\n    var box = plot.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var dot = g.querySelector('.mlc-dot').getBoundingClientRect();\n    tip.textContent = g.getAttribute('data-tip').replace(/&middot;/g, '·');\n    tip.hidden = false;\n    var x = dot.left + dot.width / 2 - box.left;\n    var w = tip.offsetWidth;\n    tip.style.left = Math.max(4, Math.min(box.width - w - 4, x - w / 2)) + 'px';\n    tip.style.top  = (dot.top - box.top - tip.offsetHeight - 12) + 'px';\n    g.classList.add('is-on');\n  }\n  function hide() {\n    tip.hidden = true;\n    Array.prototype.forEach.call(host.querySelectorAll('.mlc-pt.is-on'),\n      function (e) { e.classList.remove('is-on'); });\n  }\n  Array.prototype.forEach.call(host.querySelectorAll('.mlc-pt'), function (g) {\n    g.addEventListener('mouseenter', function (e) { hide(); show(g, e); });\n    g.addEventListener('touchstart', function (e) { hide(); show(g, e); }, {passive: true});\n  });\n  plot.addEventListener('mouseleave', hide);\n})();\n</script>","_title":"Clicks chart"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a20ddf","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"_title":"Words"},"elements":[{"id":"a1eef0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>MacroLingoは、結果を重視した検索マーケティングを提供します。高付加価値産業やグローバル市場に向けて、SEO（検索エンジン最適化）とGEO（生成エンジン最適化）を実施。技術・科学の専門知識とAIを活用し、見つけやすく信頼性の高い、長期的に効果を発揮するコンテンツを作成します。</p>","_css_classes":"ml-bio-wide","_title":"The argument","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"a4f447","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"services","css_classes":"ml-inner ml-jp ml-band-blue","_title":"What we do"},"elements":[{"id":"a4788b","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bott